flowchart TD
    Entity[existing JCIEntity target] -->|CHANGED_BY| ChangeEvent
    ChangeEvent -. pending means TRIGGERS = 0 .-> Pending[no completed event yet]
    ChangeEvent --> Run[technical SyncRun with unique runId]
    Run --> Check[SYNC validates graph and RaN]
    Check --> Success[SUCCESS]
    Check --> Conflict[CONFLICT]
    Check --> Failed[FAILED]
    Success -->|only when an existing state is replaced| History[create PiH]
    Success --> Current[commit new state]
    Success --> SyncEvent[immutable SyncEvent with the runId]
    Conflict --> SyncEvent
    Failed --> SyncEvent
    ChangeEvent -->|TRIGGERS| SyncEvent
    SyncEvent -->|AFFECTS| Affected[resolved JCIEntity required for SUCCESS or CONFLICT]
    Failed -. may have no AFFECTS only before target resolution .-> SyncEvent
    Success -. CREATED only .-> NewEntity[new JCIEntity revision 1 and no PiH]
    NewEntity -->|CHANGED_BY| ChangeEvent
    CorrectionEvent[ChangeEvent HISTORICAL_CORRECTION] -->|TARGETS_HISTORY| ExistingHistory[PiH immutable]
    CorrectionEvent -. completed SyncRun .-> CorrectionSyncEvent[SyncEvent]
    CorrectionEvent -->|TRIGGERS| CorrectionSyncEvent
    CorrectionSyncEvent -->|CREATES_CORRECTION| Correction[HistoricalCorrection]
    Correction -->|CORRECTS| ExistingHistory

